<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Specialty appoints new managing director.</title>
<headline>Specialty appoints new managing director.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Stores Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed Alastair McArthur as new group managing director.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement McArthur would be working closely with executive chairmen Stewart Cohen and Laurie Chiappini to further growth in the Speciality Stores group.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
